   104	     proposal check (the run did not finish its step).
   105	6. **End write (single door):** `set_run_status(conn, ticket_id, status=<mapped>, worker=None,
   106	   session_key=result.session_key, now=now)` — one atomic UPDATE writes status + cleared worker +
   107	   the resolved durable key together, so a later step resumes the right session.
