./orchestration/tickets/T02-verify/ticket.md:17:4. Pytest invocations write junit XML to a temp/`data/`-ignored location for scoring; verify runs both suites even when the earlier suite fails (the scoreboard must always be complete), but records gate failure. A missing or unparseable junit file scores every item of that suite FAIL; verify never crashes on gate failure.
