./orchestration/tickets/T01-contracts/plan.md:1141:- No resolution verbs exist: no accept, approve, grant, unblock, or day-plan subcommands anywhere in the tree (§8).
./orchestration/tickets/T01-contracts/plan.md:1197:- **No dispatcher behavior**: no tick, no eligibility/ordering evaluation, no claim CAS, no reclaim, no circuit breaker, no file lock — only the `Run` shapes, DDL columns, and adapter protocols.
