./orchestration/tickets/T21-dogfood-skills/codex-plan-review-raw.txt:5752:The dispatcher code confirms a key constraint: a claim attempt consumes budget only after eligibility is ordered, and fake spawn is still a normal claim path. I’m now checking whether any of the plan’s own assumptions become false because of concurrent demo data, test env, or the exact CLI verb signatures.
